{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Ir.Lowered_nests</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"arrayjit","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Ir","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Lowered_nests","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[{"title":"Nests","href":"#nests","children":[]},{"title":"Routines","href":"#routines","children":[]},{"title":"Index arithmetic","href":"#index-arithmetic","children":[]}],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>The nest view of raw lowered code shared by the recognizers of the algebraic-rewrite tier (<a href=\"../Rewrites/index.html\"><code>Rewrites</code></a>): <a href=\"../Online_softmax/index.html\"><code>Online_softmax</code></a> and <a href=\"../Prefix_scan/index.html\"><code>Prefix_scan</code></a> read a routine as its top-level statements, each either a perfect serial nest with one <code>Set</code> at the bottom or opaque to them, plus a census of who writes and reads which node.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-(let*)\"><a href=\"#val-(let*)\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> (let*) : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> option</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>(<span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'b</span> option</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"type-var\">'b</span> option</span></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"nests\"><a href=\"#nests\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Nests</h2><p>Every <code>Accum_op</code> lowers to one top-level nest: serial loops from the outside in and a single <code>Set</code> at the bottom. A guard, a scan or a hardware-annotated loop anywhere in a statement makes it invisible to the recognizers.</p><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-loop\"><a href=\"#type-loop\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> loop</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-loop.index\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-loop.index\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>index : <a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-loop.from_\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-loop.from_\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>from_ : int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-loop.to_\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-loop.to_\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>to_ : int;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-nest\"><a href=\"#type-nest\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> nest</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-nest.loops\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-nest.loops\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>loops : <span><a href=\"#type-loop\">loop</a> list</span>;</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Outermost first.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-nest.tn\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-nest.tn\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>tn : <a href=\"../Tnode/index.html#type-t\">Tnode.t</a>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-nest.idcs\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-nest.idcs\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>idcs : <span><a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-axis_index\">Indexing.axis_index</a> array</span>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-nest.llsc\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-nest.llsc\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>llsc : <a href=\"../Low_level/index.html#type-scalar_t\">Low_level.scalar_t</a>;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-nest_of\"><a href=\"#val-nest_of\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> nest_of : <span><a href=\"../Low_level/index.html#type-t\">Low_level.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-nest\">nest</a> option</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-opaque_effect\"><a href=\"#val-opaque_effect\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> opaque_effect : <span><span><a href=\"../Tnode/index.html#type-t\">Tnode.t</a> <a href=\"../Affine/index.html#type-statement_effect\">Affine.statement_effect</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Whether an effect row is code the census cannot see, or that a rewrite must not move a write across.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-wrap\"><a href=\"#val-wrap\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> wrap : <span><span><a href=\"#type-loop\">loop</a> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Low_level/index.html#type-t\">Low_level.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../Low_level/index.html#type-t\">Low_level.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Serial loops around a body, the first loop outermost.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-mentions\"><a href=\"#val-mentions\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> mentions : <span><a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-axis_index\">Indexing.axis_index</a> array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Whether a plain iterator of the symbol is among the indices.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_loop\"><a href=\"#val-is_loop\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_loop : <span><a href=\"#type-nest\">nest</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-reduction\"><a href=\"#val-reduction\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> reduction : <span><a href=\"#type-nest\">nest</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>(<a href=\"../Ops/index.html#type-binop\">Ops.binop</a> * <a href=\"../Low_level/index.html#type-scalar_t\">Low_level.scalar_t</a>)</span> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The accumulation operator and the accumulated operand of a nest <code>lhs[i] := lhs[i] op rhs</code> (either operand order for <code>Add</code> and <code>Max</code>) whose <code>rhs</code> does not read <code>lhs</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-pointwise\"><a href=\"#val-pointwise\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> pointwise : <span><a href=\"#type-nest\">nest</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>An elementwise definition: the value reads no cell of its own target.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-map_scalar\"><a href=\"#val-map_scalar\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> map_scalar : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">idx</span>:<span>(<span><a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-axis_index\">Indexing.axis_index</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-axis_index\">Indexing.axis_index</a> option</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">get</span>:<span>(<span><a href=\"../Tnode/index.html#type-t\">Tnode.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-axis_index\">Indexing.axis_index</a> array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Low_level/index.html#type-scalar_t\">Low_level.scalar_t</a> option</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Low_level/index.html#type-scalar_t\">Low_level.scalar_t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"../Low_level/index.html#type-scalar_t\">Low_level.scalar_t</a> * bool)</span> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The expression with every index rewritten by <code>idx</code> and every read <code>get</code> answers replaced, and whether any read was replaced. A scope, local, dynamic or merge-buffer read declines.</p></div></div><h2 id=\"routines\"><a href=\"#routines\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Routines</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-routine\"><a href=\"#type-routine\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> routine</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-routine.stmts\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-routine.stmts\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>stmts : <span><a href=\"../Low_level/index.html#type-t\">Low_level.t</a> array</span>;</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>The top-level statements, in order.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-routine.nests\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-routine.nests\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>nests : <span><span><a href=\"#type-nest\">nest</a> option</span> array</span>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-routine.writers\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-routine.writers\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>writers : <span><span>(<a href=\"../Tnode/index.html#type-t\">Tnode.t</a>, <span>int list</span>)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.Hashtbl.t</span>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-routine.reads\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-routine.reads\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>reads : <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.Set.M(<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ir</span>.Tnode).t array</span>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-routine.opaque\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-routine.opaque\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>opaque : <span>bool array</span>;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The census is read off each statement's relations (gh-ocannl-1050), which enter loop, scan, guard and scope bodies alike. A merge-buffer read counts as a read of its source node.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-routine_of\"><a href=\"#val-routine_of\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> routine_of : <span><a href=\"../Low_level/index.html#type-t\">Low_level.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-routine\">routine</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-writers\"><a href=\"#val-writers\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> writers : <span><a href=\"#type-routine\">routine</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Tnode/index.html#type-t\">Tnode.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The positions of the statements writing the node, ascending.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-reads_at\"><a href=\"#val-reads_at\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> reads_at : <span><a href=\"#type-routine\">routine</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.Set.M(<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ir</span>.Tnode).t</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-definition\"><a href=\"#val-definition\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> definition : <span><a href=\"#type-routine\">routine</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Tnode/index.html#type-t\">Tnode.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>(int * <a href=\"#type-nest\">nest</a>)</span> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The one pointwise nest defining the node, if it is defined exactly once and elementwise.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-covers_whole\"><a href=\"#val-covers_whole\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> covers_whole : <span><a href=\"#type-nest\">nest</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Whether a nest writes every cell of its node once: instantiating a definition at arbitrary subscripts is sound only then.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-unfold\"><a href=\"#val-unfold\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> unfold : \u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-routine\">routine</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">stop</span>:<span><a href=\"../Tnode/index.html#type-t\">Tnode.t</a> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">before</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">depth</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Low_level/index.html#type-scalar_t\">Low_level.scalar_t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"../Low_level/index.html#type-scalar_t\">Low_level.scalar_t</a> * <span>int list</span>)</span> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The expression a read stands for, unfolded through single-writer elementwise definitions and constant fills (short of the <code>stop</code> nodes) that write their whole node at a position before <code>before</code>, with the positions of the definitions it went through.</p></div></div><h2 id=\"index-arithmetic\"><a href=\"#index-arithmetic\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Index arithmetic</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-terms_of\"><a href=\"#val-terms_of\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> terms_of : \u000A  <span><a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-axis_index\">Indexing.axis_index</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><span>(int * <a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a>)</span> list</span> * int)</span> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>An index as affine terms and an offset; <code>None</code> for a sub-axis or a concatenation.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-subst_idx\"><a href=\"#val-subst_idx\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> subst_idx : \u000A  <span><span>(<span><a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-axis_index\">Indexing.axis_index</a> option</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-axis_index\">Indexing.axis_index</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-axis_index\">Indexing.axis_index</a> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The index with each symbol the map answers replaced by its image, affinely.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-subst_scalar\"><a href=\"#val-subst_scalar\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> subst_scalar : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?get</span>:<span>(<span><a href=\"../Tnode/index.html#type-t\">Tnode.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-axis_index\">Indexing.axis_index</a> array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Low_level/index.html#type-scalar_t\">Low_level.scalar_t</a> option</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Indexing/index.html#type-axis_index\">Indexing.axis_index</a> option</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Low_level/index.html#type-scalar_t\">Low_level.scalar_t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Low_level/index.html#type-scalar_t\">Low_level.scalar_t</a> option</span></span></code></div></div>"}